["ādigaurīsamudbhūtatejasoṃśabhavāya vai", "tanotu vāgvilāsaṃ me jihvāyāṃ sā sarasvatī", "prāsādamaṇḍanaṃ brūte sūtradhāreṣu maṇḍanaḥ", "sa eva vidhinā kāryo devatāyataneṣvapi", "pāvanaṃ śaṅkarasthānaṃ tatra sarvaiḥ śivo'rcitaḥ", "caturdaśa samutpannāḥ prāsādānāṃ ca jātayaḥ", "sārvadhārā vimānādināgarāḥ puṣpakāṅkitāḥ", "sarvadeveṣu kartavyāḥ śivasyāpi viśeṣataḥ", "caturdaśa pravartante jñeyā lokānusārataḥ", "prāsādabhavanādīnāṃ sarvajñānamavāpyate", "māsasaṅkrāntivatsādiniṣedhe kālavarjite", "bhuvaṃ parīkṣya siñcet tu pañcagavyena kovidaḥ", "catuḥṣaṣṭipadairvāstuṃ likhedvāpi śatāṃśakaiḥ", "pūrvoktena vidhānena balipuṣpādipūjanaiḥ", "kuberaḥ īśaḥ patayaḥ pūrvādīnāṃ diśāṃ kramāt", "ityeṣāṃ vidhivatpūjāṃ kṛtvā karma samārabhet", "vaidhṛtau vyatipāte bhedagdhe neṣṭaṃ kadācana", "sṛṣṭyā vatsamukhaṃ tatra svāmino hānikṛdyataḥ", "dhvajāyo devanakṣatraṃ vyayāṃśau prathamau śubhau", "hīna āyād vyayaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ piśācastu samo'dhikaḥ", "navāṅgaṃ nāḍivedyādisthāpakābha . . . . yormithaḥ", "māsanakṣatralagnādicintanaṃ pūrvaśāstrataḥ", "same bhūmipradeśe tu śaṅkunā divase'thavā", "pāṣāṇāntaṃ jalāntaṃ vā tataḥ kūrmaṃ niveśayet", "ardhāṅgulā tato vṛddhiḥ kāryā tithikarāvadhiḥ", "tato'rddhādi śatārddhāntaṃ kūrmo manvaṅgulo mataḥ", "sauvarṇo rūpyajo vāpi snāpyaḥ pañcāsṛtena hi", "īśānādagnikoṇādvā śilāḥ sthāpyāḥ pradakṣiṇāḥ", "balidānaṃ ca naivedyaṃ vividhānnaṃ ghṛtaplutam", "brāhme puṣye mṛge maitre pauṣṇavāsavavāruṇe", "mṛgaśīrṣe ca revatyāmuttarātritaye śubhaḥ", "vāṭīvāpitaḍāgādisthāne kāryaṃ murālayam", "devatāyatanaṃ kuryāddharmārthakāmamokṣadam", "dharmavṛddhirbhavedathaḥ kāmo mokṣastato nṛṇām", "aiṣṭake śatakoṭighnaṃ śaile'nantaṃ phalaṃ gṛhe", "ghaṭe dhvaje pratiṣṭhāyāmevaṃ puṇyāhasaptakam", "khure dvārocchraye kumbhe paṭṭe padmaśilāsu ca", "dhvajocchrāya ca kurvīta śāntikāni caturdaśaṃ", "pramāṇaṃ kumbhake mūlanāsike bhittibāhyataḥ", "pīṭhasya nirgamo bāhyastathaiva cchādyakasya ca", "prāsādamaṅgasraṃkhyā ca vārimārgāntarasthitāḥ", "sāmānyo'yaṃ vidhistulyo hastāṅgulaśca nirgamaḥ", "iti śrīsūtradhāramaṇḍanaviracite prāsādamaṇḍane vāstuśāstre miśrakalakṣaṇe prathamo'dhyāyaḥ", "yathā siṃhāsanaṃ rājñāṃ prāsādasya tathaiva sā", "jagatī pañcadhā proktā prāsādasyānurūpyataḥ", "kramāt pañcaguṇā proktā jyeṣṭhā madhyā kanīyasī", "prāsāde jagatī kāryā surūpā lakṣaṇānvitā", "dvārakāyāṃ tu kartavyā tathaiva puruṣatraye", "dviguṇā vāyatā kāryā sahasrāyatane vidhiḥ", "ucchrayaḥ svatribhāgena bhramaṇīnāṃ samucchrayaḥ", "aṣṭāviṃśatiṣaṭtriṃśatkoṇaiḥ syuḥ pañca phālanāḥ", "dvātriṃśatī caturthāṃśo bhūtāṃśoccā śatārddhaka", "sūryajainaśatārddhāntaṃ kramāddvitriyugāṃśakaiḥ", "tripado jāḍyakumbhaśca dvipadaṃ kaṇakaṃ tathā", "dvipadaṃ khurakaṃ kuryāt saptabhāgaṃ ca kumbhakam", "kapotālistribhāge ca puṣpakaṇṭho yugāṃśakaiḥ", "karṇeṣu ca diśāṃpālāḥ prācyādiṣu pradakṣiṇāḥ", "prākārairjalaniṣkāsaiḥ sopānaistoraṇādibhiḥ", "toraṇaṃ kārayet tasya paṭṭaṃ paṭṭānusārataḥ", "bhittigarbhapramāṇena tayormadhye'thavā bhavet", "vicitraṃ toraṇaṃ kuryād dolā devasya tatra ca", "ekadvitricatuṣpañcarasasaptapadāntare", "guhyanābhistanāntaṃ vā trividho vāhanodayaḥ", "vṛṣasya viṣṇubhāgānte sūrye vyomastanāntakam", "gūḍhasyāgre catuṣkā syāttadagre nṛtyamaṇḍapam", "jinālaye caturdikṣu sahitaṃ jinamandiram", "aṣṭāpadaṃ prakartavyaṃ triśālā vā varāṇakam", "uttare ratharandhraṃ ca proktaṃ śrīviśvakarmaṇā", "bhinnacchandā na kartavyā prāsādāsanasaṃsthistā", "prāsādaṃ kārayedantarnābhivedhavivarjitam", "prabhā naṣṭā na bhogāya yathā tārā divākare", "viṣṇoragre bhavedviṣṇurjino jaine ravau raviḥ", "śivasyāgre'nyadevasya dṛṣṭivedhe mahadbhayam", "sthāpayedanyadevāṃśca tatra doṣo na vidyate", "pṛ0 8) dṛṣṭaṃ na laṅghayet tatra hanti puṇyaṃ purākṛtam", "catasro vāsudevasya śivasyārdhā pradakṣiṇā", "kuryānna darśayetpṛṣṭhaṃ saṃmukhaṃ dvāralaṅghanam", "iti śāstravicāro'yamuttareśānadevatāḥ", "praṇālaṃ kārayeddhīmān jagatyāṃ ca caturdiśam", "brahmaviṣṇuśivārkendraguhāḥ pūrvāparāṅmukhāḥ", "gaṇeśo dhanado lakṣmīḥ puradvāre sukhāvahāḥ", "mātaro dhanadaścaiva śubhā dakṣiṇadiṅmukhāḥ", "anye vidiṅmukhā devā na kartavyāḥ kadācana", "sūryādgaṇeśo viṣṇuśca caṇḍī śambhuḥ pradakṣiṇe", "gaṇeśasya gṛhe tadvaccaṇḍī śaṃbhurharī raviḥ", "iti gaṇeśāyatanam", "sthāpyāstasthāvatārasya mūrtayo dvārakāṃ tathā", "mātaro mūrtayo devā yoginyo bhairavādayaḥ", "sthāpyāḥ sarve śivasthāne dṛṣṭivedhavivarjitāḥ", "dakṣiṇāṅge bhavedbrahmā viparyāse bhayāvahāḥ", "tattulyā pārvatīdevī sukhadā sarvakāmadā", "iti prāsādamaṇḍane jagatīdṛṣṭidoṣāyatanādhikāre dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ", "atīva sudṛḍhā kāryā iṣṭikācūrṇavāribhiḥ", "ardhāṅgulā bhavedvṛddhiryāvaddhastaśatārdhakam", "pṛ0 10) pañcadig viṃśatiryāvacchatārdhaṃ ca vivardhayet", "svasvodayapramāṇasya carturthāṃśena nirgamaḥ", "caturhaste trisārddhāṃśaṃ pādāṃśaṃ pañcahastake", "vṛddhirvedatriyugmaikasaṃkhyā syādaṅgulaiḥ kramāt", "tripañcāśat samutsedhe dvāviṃtyaṃśanirgame", "sāntarālaṃ kapotāliḥ saptāṃśā grāsapaṭṭikā", "vājisthāne'thavā kāryaṃ svaṃ svaṃ devasya vāhanam", "trisārddhaṃ kaṇakaṃ sārddhaṃ caturbhirgrāsapaṭṭikā", "antarālamadhasteṣāmūrdhvārdhakarṇayugmakam", "jāḍyakumbhaḥ kaṇālī ca grāsapaṭṭī tadā bhavet", "latine nirgame hīne sādhāre nirgamādhikam", "pīṭhahīnaṃ vināśāya prāsādabhuvanādikam", "sa kramānnavasapteṣurāmacaṃdrauṅgulo'dhikaḥ", "haste haste kramādvṛddhirmanusūryanavāṅgulā", "haste sūryāṅgulā vṛddhiryāvattriṃśatkarāvadhi", "pīṭhorddhe udayaścaiva chādyānte nāgarodhikam", "pañcādinavabhāgāntaṃ pīṭhasya pañcadhodayaḥ", "khurakaḥ pañcabhāgaṃ syādviṃśatiḥkumbhakastathā", "kapotikāṣṭau mañcī syāt kartavyā navabhāgikā", "vasubhirbharaṇi kāryā śirāpaṭṭī daśāṃśikā", "chādyaṃ trayodaśāṃśoccaṃ daśabhāgairvinirgamaḥ", "pañcaviṃśatikā jaṅghā udagmaśca trayodaśa", "saptabhāgā bhavenmañcī kūṭachādyasya mastake", "śirāvaṭī caturbhāgā paṭṭaḥsyātpañcabhāgikaḥ", "kumbhakasya yugāṃśena sthāvarāṇāṃ praveśakaḥ", "alpadravye mahatpuṇyaṃ kathitaṃ viśvakarmaṇā", "dvādaśānāṃ khurādīnāṃ bhāgasaṃkhyā krameṇa tu", "sārddhasyārdhārdhabhāgaiḥ syāddvisārdhairdvyaṃśanirgamaḥ", "sādhāra'ṣṭāṃśato bhittirdaśāṃśairdhāturatnaje", "phālanīyaṃ garbhagṛha doṣadaṃ garbhamāyatam", "bharaṇyā bharaṇaṃ śīrṣaṃ kapotālyā samaṃ bhavet", "saṣaḍaṃśaḥ sapādasya sārdho garbhasya vistarāt", "bhavedaṣṭābhirekāṃśā kumbhastambho'rddhapañcabhiḥ", "pṛ0 13) vyāsārdhena karoṭaṃ syādarddhayoviṣamāśrutā", "tadadhaḥ pañcaratnāni sthāpayet śilpipūjanāt", "vṛttaṃ mandārakaṃ kuryāt mṛṇālaṃ padmasaṃyutam", "udumbarasya pārśve ca śākhāyāṃ stalarūpakam", "taddvayaṃ kaṇakaṃ madhye pīṭhake bāhyabhūmikā", "dvāravyāsasama dairghyaṃ nirgamañca tadardhataḥ", "śaṅkhapatrasamāyuktaṃ padmākārairalaṅkṛtam", "ṣoḍaśāṅgulikā vṛddhiryāvaddhastacatuṣṭayam", "dvyaṅgulamatihastañca yāvaddhastaśatārdhakam", "daidhyārdhena pṛthutve syācchobhanaṃ tatkalādhikam", "pṛ0 14) sūryāṅgulā pratikaraṃ vṛddhiḥpañcakarāvadhiḥ", "navāntaṃ syādyugāṅgulaṃ vṛddhiḥ kāryā karaṃ prati", "rasahastāntakaṃ yāvat tāvatā vṛddhiriṣyate", "miśrake latine caiva praśastaṃ nāgarodbhavam", "siṃhāvalokane dvāraṃ nāgaraṃ śobhanaṃ matam", "dhātuje ratnaje caiva dāruje ca rathāruhe", "pañcaśakhaṃ sāvabhaume triśākhaṃ maṇḍaleśvare", "samaśākhaṃ dhūmāya . . . śvānarāsabhavāyase", "hīnaśākhaṃ na kartavyamadhikārddhaṃ sukhāvaham", "āpaddoṣaviśuddhyarthaṃ hrāso vṛddhirna duṣyati", "madhye dvibhāgikaṃ kuryāt stambhaṃ puruṣasaṃjñakam", "nirgame caikabhāgena rūpastambhaḥ praśasyate", "dvibhāgaṃ nirgame kuryāt stambhaṃ dravyānusārataḥ", "koṇikā stambhamadhye tu bhūṣaṇārthā hi pārśvataḥ", "stambhaṃ śākhādikaṃ śeṣe triśākhāvadvibhājayet", "caturthī svalpaśākhā ca siṃhaśākhā ca pañcamī", "caturthī stambhaśākhā ca rūpaśākhā ca pañcamī", "stambhaśākhā bhavenmadhye rūpaśākhāgrasūtrataḥ", "caturthī śalyaśākhā ca gandharvā tvatha pañcamī", "śalyaśākhā ca siṃhākhyā mūlakarṇena saṃmitā", "pṛ0 16) śākhāyāñca parīvāro gaṇeśaścottarāṅgake", "iti prāsādamaṇḍane vāstuśāstre pīṭhamaṇḍovaragarbhagṛha udumbarapramāṇaṃ tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ", "śeṣe tryaṃśe dvibhāgārccā tryaṃśonā dvārato'thavā", "ūrdhvārcā āsanasthā ca manuviśvārkabhāgataḥ", "bhittirdvibhāgā kartavyā ṣaṭbhāgaṃ garbhamandiram", "madhyamā svadaśāṃśonā pañcāṃśonā kanīyasī", "sapt