aṃ jīvanyāsaṃ kṛtvā pratiṣṭhayet", "kharaśilāyāṃ ca vārāhaṃ paulyāṃ nāgakulāni ca", "nandinī jāḍyakumbhe ca kalyāṇyāṃ sthāpayeddharim", "narapīṭhe narāṃścaiva kṣamāṃ ca khurake yajet", "kapotālyāṃ ca gandharvānmañcikāyāṃ sarasvatīm", "sāvitrīṃ bharaṇe deśe śirāvadyāṃ ca devikām", "paryaṅkakuṃṭhacchādye ca tato madhye pratiṣṭhayet", "udumbare sthitaṃ yakṣamaśvināvardhacandrake", "stambheṣu parvatāṃścaivamākāśaṃ ca karoṭake", "śikharasyoruśṛṅgeṣu pañca pañca pratiṣṭhayet", "śikhare ceśvaraṃ devaṃ śikhāyāṃ tu surādhipam", "padmākṣaṃ padmapatraṃ ca kalaśe ca sadāśivam", "karṇādibhadraparyantaṃ pañcāṅge tān pratiṣṭhayet", "vipraṃ kumārikāṃ vāstuṃ tato lokānpradarśayet", "vastrālaṅkārabhūvittagomahiṣyāśvavāhanaiḥ", "svādhikārānusāreṇa vastratāmbūlabhojanaiḥ", "bhuñjate tatra bhoktāsau śaṅkarastridaśaiḥ saha", "sūtradhāro vadet svāminna kṣayaṃ bhavatāt tava", "dānaṃ dadyāddvijātibhyo dīnāndhadurbaleṣu ca", "vitte datte pratuṣyanti mānuṣyāḥ pitaraḥ surāḥ", "navakāraiḥ sūramantraiśca siddhiḥ kevalabhāṣitam", "pṛ0 41) yenānantavibhedena muktimārga udāhṛtaḥ", "siddha kālatrayo jātāścaturviṃśatimūrtayaḥ", "sāvantaśikharaṃ? mandiramaṣṭāpadādikam", "kalyāṇakārivargasya caturdikṣu prakalpayet", "taḍāgasya caturmāsaṃ kuryādāṣāḍhamārgayoḥ", "saṃskṛte tṛptimāyānti tasmātsaṃskāramācaret", "datte vā sa labhetsaukhyamurvyāṃ svarge ca mānavaḥ", "svedastasmātsamudbhūtaṃ bhūtamatyantaduḥsaham", "jānunī koṇayo pādau rakṣo diśi śive śiraḥ", "devyo'ṣṭau bāhyagāsteṣāṃ vasanādvāsturucyate", "tenaiva balinā śānti kurute hānimanyathā", "vāstukarmasu sarveṣu pūjitāḥ saukhyado bhavet", "dvātriṃśanmaṇḍalāni syuḥ kṣetratulyākṛtīni ca", "sarvavāstuvibhāgeṣu pūjayenmaṇḍaladvayam", "jayaḥskandhe mahendrādyāḥ pañca dakṣiṇabāhugāḥ", "vāyurjānuni pūṣādyāḥ saptapādatale sthitāḥ", "gandharvo bhṛṅgarājaśca mṛgaḥ sapta surā iti", "dauvāriko'tha sugrīvaḥ puṣpadanto jalādhipaḥ", "ahirmukhyaśca bhallāṭaḥ somasarpauca bāhugau", "dvātriṃśadbāhyagā devā nābhipṛṣṭhe sthito vidhiḥ", "vivasvāna'tha mitraśca dakṣavāmorugāvubhau", "sāvitraḥ savitā tadvatkaraṃ dakṣiṇamāśritau", "bhadradāso'pi tatraiva iti devamayaṃ vapuḥ", "vidārikāgnikoṇe ca vijṛmbhāpāṃdigāsthitā", "pāparākṣasikā saumye'ryamā vai sarvato'rcayet", "aparān vaṭakānnaiśca sarvān svarṇasugandhibhiḥ", "iti śrīsūtradhāramaṇḍanaviracite vāstuśāstre prāsādamaṇḍane'ṣṭamo'dhyāyaḥ"]